00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:06.559
and that means that is the Korean

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:08.080
formula and not the US formula. So, make

00:20:06.559 --> 00:20:10.320
sure to get that one. I also use the

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:12.080
Haruhar mineral sunscreen version of

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:14.000
this one when my skin is feeling extra

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:16.799
sensitive. Another sunscreen that I

