absolutely love is the beauty of hosan

00:20:16.799 --> 00:20:20.960
sunscreen and it is also a bestseller on

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.640
Yes Style and that one is a chemical

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:24.559
sunscreen. If you like very light

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:26.480
sunscreen formulas that feels matte and

00:20:24.559 --> 00:20:27.760
not oily or heavy at all, this is the

