00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:38.720
specifically. They're okay, but they're

00:20:36.559 --> 00:20:40.640
just not good enough. So, if I'm buying

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:42.400
sunscreen in the US, it's going to be

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:44.640
mineral. So, what are some of my

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:46.480
dermatologist prescribed treatments? So

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.400
beyond the topical products that I

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:50.640
mentioned and my dermatologist approved

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:52.960
them, my dermatologist also prescribed

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:55.679
me a few things. One of which is oral

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:57.440
transmic acid. I take this twice a day

00:20:55.679 --> 00:21:00.640
and the research supports oralot

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:02.799
transmic acid at 250 to 500 milligrams

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.919
twice daily for reducing pigmentation.

00:21:02.799 --> 00:21:05.600
Now just don't take this if you're

00:21:03.919 --> 00:21:07.360
