Pico laser delivers ultra short pauses

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:18.159
of energy that breaks up pigmentation

00:26:16.159 --> 00:26:20.640
without damaging surrounding tissue. It

00:26:18.159 --> 00:26:22.799
is specifically designed for pigmented

00:26:20.640 --> 00:26:24.400
and ethnic skin. There are other lasers

00:26:22.799 --> 00:26:26.640
that help with pigmentation as well, but

00:26:24.400 --> 00:26:27.840
