00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:30.000
I'm only telling you what my

00:26:27.840 --> 00:26:32.400
dermatologist recommended for my skin.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:34.240
Lifestyle changes that matter. This part

00:26:32.400 --> 00:26:36.400
is just as important as all day

00:26:34.240 --> 00:26:38.640
products. But first of all, sun

00:26:36.400 --> 00:26:40.799
avoidance is a requirement. You may

00:26:38.640 --> 00:26:43.679
notice now that my window blinds are up

00:26:40.799 --> 00:26:46.400
now that the sun is down. But my blinds

00:26:43.679 --> 00:26:48.960
have been drawn for weeks every single

00:26:46.400 --> 00:26:51.360
day. I barely went outside without any

00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:53.840
kind of physical sun protection. So, sun

00:26:51.360 --> 00:26:56.559
hats, umbrellas, sunglasses, and I'm

00:26:53.840 --> 00:26:59.440
talking the big shield sunglasses, UPF

00:26:56.559 --> 00:27:01.440
clothing, UPF mask, and I reapply

00:26:59.440 --> 00:27:03.840
sunscreen multiple times throughout the

00:27:01.440 --> 00:27:06.320
day. If I'm out all day long, my formula

00:27:03.840 --> 00:27:08.559
is 9:00 a.m., 12:00 p.m., 3:00 p.m.,

00:27:06.320 --> 00:27:10.400
6:00 p.m. quadrants. That way, I don't

00:27:08.559 --> 00:27:12.480
forget. And when I'm doing outdoor

00:27:10.400 --> 00:27:14.960
activities and when I go to the pool, I

00:27:12.480 --> 00:27:16.799
only go after the sun set. So, I'm not

00:27:14.960 --> 00:27:19.200
directly under the sun. And the thing

00:27:16.799 --> 00:27:21.120
is, I love the sun. So, this kills me.

00:27:19.200 --> 00:27:22.880
The sun makes me so happy. You guys know

00:27:21.120 --> 00:27:24.799
I moved to Miami just so that I can get

00:27:22.880 --> 00:27:26.880
even more sun and I had to develop such

00:27:24.799 --> 00:27:28.400
a disciplined relationship with it,

00:27:26.880 --> 00:27:30.960
especially while I'm healing my skin

00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:33.200
because UV exposure is the fastest way

00:27:30.960 --> 00:27:35.360
to undo everything. And I know this

00:27:33.200 --> 00:27:37.200
because I've had hyperpigmentation on

00:27:35.360 --> 00:27:39.140
another spot of my body that is always

00:27:37.200 --> 00:27:40.720
covered and that healed in like a

00:27:39.140 --> 00:27:43.120
[music] week. Another thing you have to

00:27:40.720 --> 00:27:44.880
keep in mind is no intense workouts or

00:27:43.120 --> 00:27:46.320
sweating while you're healing. Raising

00:27:44.880 --> 00:27:48.080
your body temperature increases

00:27:46.320 --> 00:27:50.400
inflammation and blood flow to the skin,

00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:52.480
which can worsen pigmentation. So, this

00:27:50.400 --> 00:27:54.559
is probably a good time to not be doing

00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:56.880
any kind of intense cardio or hit

00:27:54.559 --> 00:27:59.520
workouts and keep your body temperature

00:27:56.880 --> 00:28:01.840
cool, keep your skin cool. Cool skin is

00:27:59.520 --> 00:28:04.320
calm skin. Remember that. So, no steam

00:28:01.840 --> 00:28:06.399
room, no sauna. Same principle. Heat is

00:28:04.320 --> 00:28:08.480
the enemy right now. And lastly, stay

00:28:06.399 --> 00:28:10.240
consistent because this is not a try

00:28:08.480 --> 00:28:12.000
this for 3 days and see what happens

00:28:10.240 --> 00:28:14.399
kind of situation. This is a whole

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:16.080
protocol. You use it every day. You

00:28:14.399 --> 00:28:18.159
protect your skin every day and you give

00:28:16.080 --> 00:28:20.399
it time while also being aggressive with

00:28:18.159 --> 00:28:22.080
the right treatments. So, who to go to

00:28:20.399 --> 00:28:24.080
and who to avoid? Let me tell you the

00:28:22.080 --> 00:28:25.440
full story what happened to me because I

00:28:24.080 --> 00:28:27.279
wanted to protect you from making the

00:28:25.440 --> 00:28:29.440
same mistake that I did. So, I went to

00:28:27.279 --> 00:28:31.200
the med spa for a CO2 laser treatment

00:28:29.440 --> 00:28:33.120
and this was supposed to be a once every

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:34.640
5 to 10 years kind of thing. You go in,

00:28:33.120 --> 00:28:36.799
your skin resurfaces, you come out

00:28:34.640 --> 00:28:39.360
looking reborn because it's so intense

