is beautiful, evenly toned skin, smooth

00:28:42.559 --> 00:28:47.360
like baby skin. But the provider used

00:28:44.880 --> 00:28:50.159
settings that are far too powerful for

00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:52.240
me. Asian skin is highly reactive to

00:28:50.159 --> 00:28:54.159
pigmentation changes. They should know

00:28:52.240 --> 00:28:56.240
this. I actually asked them to send me

00:28:54.159 --> 00:28:58.640
the medical notes and I read it and it

00:28:56.240 --> 00:29:01.360
said that she used one single setting on

00:28:58.640 --> 00:29:03.279
my face and my neck across all areas.

00:29:01.360 --> 00:29:05.039
There was no adjustments for different

00:29:03.279 --> 00:29:07.279
skin zones on my face and neck. There

00:29:05.039 --> 00:29:09.200
was literally zero consideration for my

00:29:07.279 --> 00:29:11.840
Fitzpatrick skin [music] type. Honestly,

00:29:09.200 --> 00:29:14.480
I am just so glad I healed from it. And

00:29:11.840 --> 00:29:16.640
this happened a while ago, but I was so

00:29:14.480 --> 00:29:18.159
furious and they know how bad they

